{"3806380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Courier Life Simulator", "steam_appid": 3806380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📦 Courier Life Simulator - Alpha</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Delivery Empire — One Package at a Time</strong>Ever wondered what it’s really like to live the life of a courier?<br>In <strong>Courier Life Simulator</strong>, you don’t just deliver packages — <strong>you live the job</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a small-time delivery worker, clock in for your shift, load your vehicle, fight traffic, manage time, earn money,, and grow into a true delivery professional. Every decision matters, every delivery counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚚 Start Your Shift. Do the Job. Get Paid.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/81880327a65e28cc9beeefbab8d83e8f.poster.avif?t=1774695423\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/81880327a65e28cc9beeefbab8d83e8f.webm?t=1774695423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/81880327a65e28cc9beeefbab8d83e8f.mp4?t=1774695423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Clock in and prepare for your daily route<br>✔ Accept delivery jobs with different challenges<br>✔ Manage your time, fuel, and efficiency<br>✔ Experience the routine — and pressure — of real courier work</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>hands-on, immersive simulation</strong>, where you feel like you’re actually on the job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📦 Load, Drive &amp; Deliver — Realistic Delivery Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/81733f6022b63643909f60741d00330b.poster.avif?t=1774695423\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/81733f6022b63643909f60741d00330b.webm?t=1774695423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/81733f6022b63643909f60741d00330b.mp4?t=1774695423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗 Buy Personal Cars &amp; Drive Freely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/8b1f11e7625d7c7006fa89c4674a72a9.poster.avif?t=1774695423\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/8b1f11e7625d7c7006fa89c4674a72a9.webm?t=1774695423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/8b1f11e7625d7c7006fa89c4674a72a9.mp4?t=1774695423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Buy <strong>personal cars</strong> — not a company fleet<br>✔ Drive anytime, even outside of work<br>✔ Enjoy realistic handling and car physics<br>✔ Explore the city freely with no objectives<br><br>Courier Life Simulator isn’t just about working —<br>it’s about <strong>enjoying the drive</strong>.<br><br>💸 Earn, Buy, Enjoy — Natural Progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Earn money through deliveries<br>✔ Buy better personal cars<br>✔ Improve your driving experience<br>✔ Balance work and freedom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work hard when you want.<br>Drive freely when you don’t.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Made for Simulation Fans</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Courier &amp; delivery simulators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life simulation games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person driving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-roam car games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Courier Life Simulator</strong> is built for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic courier job simulation focused on routine, responsibility, and freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open delivery system — choose what, when, and where to deliver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living world with economic opportunities outside your shift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of job realism and lifestyle freedom, allowing you to create your own path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently in Alpha:</strong> features, systems, and world content are being actively developed and expanded based on player feedback.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📦 Courier Life Simulator - Alpha</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Delivery Empire — One Package at a Time</strong>Ever wondered what it’s really like to live the life of a courier?<br>In <strong>Courier Life Simulator</strong>, you don’t just deliver packages — <strong>you live the job</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a small-time delivery worker, clock in for your shift, load your vehicle, fight traffic, manage time, earn money,, and grow into a true delivery professional. Every decision matters, every delivery counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚚 Start Your Shift. Do the Job. Get Paid.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared