 allowing you to create your own path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently in Alpha:</strong> features, systems, and world content are being actively developed and expanded based on player feedback.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Work a realistic courier job in a life-immersive simulation. Start your shift at the warehouse, load packages, complete deliveries, earn money, then switch to your personal car and freely drive through the city after work.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/4663f2eaad176fdb8370a25473cce69e2f2d6ae7/header.jpg?t=1774695423", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/b9ef2de75bf5fbee02981f2209b9cf380c14dbaf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774695423", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/b9ef2de75bf5fbee02981f2209b9cf380c14dbaf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774695423", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit) or Newer (64 bit) Windows OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7500 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / AMD RX 560 (4GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit) or Newer (64 bit) Windows OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Super / AMD RX 580 or better